          "Do not assume the 79% is a durable floor: a representative who appears to deliver on cost-of-living issues while remaining attentive to constituent concerns can hold or exceed this margin, but one who is perceived as ineffective, inaccessible, or more focused on external political battles than local economic conditions will find the opposition competitive in the next cycle."
