          "Engage the 21.45% Asian American constituency with specificity on education excellence, economic opportunity, and public safety — this is not a monolithic bloc but a diverse professional population sensitive to school quality, job market access, and neighborhood safety; incumbent performance on these metrics directly determines whether this constituency consolidates or becomes swing-eligible.",
